Package: concentration
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: chaslinux <chaslinux@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 162
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gst-1.0, python3-cryptography, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-rsvg-2.0, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, papirus-icon-theme
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/chaslinux/concentration
Description: GTK concentration memory game
 Concentration is a simple memory matching game written in Python
 using GTK 3.
 .
 The game uses icons from the Papirus icon theme as card faces,
 provides sound effects using GStreamer, and maintains an encrypted
 local high-score list.
